# Pairs with TrimCoveredBySnapshot. The GC trims to the offset floor while a
# leaf still holds a block pin, so the prefix whose only durable copy is the WAL
# - the blocked leaf has no snapshot covering it - is trimmed.
MODULE: TrimCoveredBySnapshotTrimIgnoresBlockPins
TARGET: TrimCoveredBySnapshot
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the GC ignores block pins and trims to the floor of the leaves that published offsets
PERTURBS: GcTrim

--- FIND
    /\ \A l \in Leaves : ~Blocking(l)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: block pins no longer stop the trim.
    /\ TRUE
--- END